# ERA Ecosystem — Cursor

**Global rules (always apply):** `.cursor/rules/`

| File | Role |
|------|------|
| `era-common-laws.mdc` | Language, tenancy, security, compliance, integrity |
| `era-architecture-boundaries.mdc` | Control plane vs satellites, SSO, MDM, events |
| `documentation-upkeep.mdc` | Docs as part of definition of done |
| `era-coverage-definition.mdc` | SHIPPED vs API/STUB; actor-aware COVERAGE_MATRIX |
| `task-acceptance.mdc` | Product Acceptance SSOT + sell/show vs engineering readiness routing; Bank Capability Inventory for OUT scope |
| `quality-tooling.mdc` | Acceptance / integration / design-token gates + shell bans |
| `era-managed-list-controls.mdc` | Pick-lists: ban plain text; `CatalogFieldKind` → Select/Multi/Chips/Autocomplete |
| `era-no-emergency-reset.mdc` | **Never** reset a core to green a monorepo ship — fix or split PR |
| `era-git-ship.mdc` | **полный коммит** / per-core PR workflow → `.cursor/skills/era-git-ship/` |
| `era-legal-entities-backup.mdc` | Companies master + e-taxes cache → `D:\ERA-BACKUP\` (never stash-wipe) |

**Skills:** `.cursor/skills/` — `era-readiness-matrix` (engineering API/DELIVERY), `acceptance-closeout`, `quality-gates`, `era-git-ship`.

**Per-app rules:** each project under `era-*/.cursor/rules/` (local-dev, module-map, ui). Finance: `era-finance-core/.cursor/rules/`. Shared libs: `packages/.cursor/rules/shared-packages.mdc`.

Ports and URLs: `docs/ECOSYSTEM_URLS.md`.
